Kind: ablation
Issue: #638
Takes out: the pin in ipi_call_mask() -- it strikes its own bit with preemption on, so a thread moved before it sends cross-calls the processor it arrived at, itself, and waits for an answer only it could give
Run: --entry 31 1200 -smp 4
Expect: names the processor sending it

diff --git a/uros/src/mach_kernel/x86_64/cpu/ipi.c b/uros/src/mach_kernel/x86_64/cpu/ipi.c
